%
(DMC2 SCRIPT 1)
(DMC2 EFFECTS axis-motion;digital-output;coordinate-state;external-command)
(DMC2 REQUIRES running-session;estop-clear;machine-on;interpreter-idle;all-homed)
(DMC2 RECOVERY abort-task)
(DMC2 END)
(Gauge block: double-touch top, outward 1 mm grid, fit rotated footprint in Rust.)
(Three side circuits at the same 1 mm stations and directions, 1 mm lower each time.)
(Physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
(Unexpected outside-edge downward Z contact: save/read back, vertical return above measured top, cancel.)
(No nominal block size or alignment is assumed. No tool or work offsets are changed.)
(Abort never starts a motion. Clear Fault and Pendant Mode remain the operator recovery path.)

o<gb_preview> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    (PREVIEW,stop)
    M2
o<gb_preview> endif
o<gb_save> sub
    M190 P5 Q#<_gb_sequence>
    M66 P5 L0
    #<_gb_sequence> = [#<_gb_sequence> + 1]
o<gb_save> endsub

o<gb_endpoints> sub
    #<mx> = [#1 + #<_gb_ox>]
    #<my> = [#2 + #<_gb_oy>]
    #<mz> = [#3 + #<_gb_oz>]
    #<bx> = [[#<mx> LE #<_ini[axis_x]min_limit>] OR [#<mx> GE #<_ini[axis_x]max_limit>]]
    #<by> = [[#<my> LE #<_ini[axis_y]min_limit>] OR [#<my> GE #<_ini[axis_y]max_limit>]]
    #<bz> = [[#<mz> LE #<_ini[axis_z]min_limit>] OR [#<mz> GE #<_ini[axis_z]max_limit>]]
    o<gb_endpoint_limits> if [#<bx> OR #<by> OR #<bz>]
        (ABORT,A requested block-scan endpoint reaches a configured travel boundary. No clipped or substitute move was issued. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<gb_endpoint_limits> endif
    #<_gb_from_x> = #<_x>
    #<_gb_from_y> = #<_y>
    #<_gb_from_z> = #<_z>
    #<_gb_to_x> = #1
    #<_gb_to_y> = #2
    #<_gb_to_z> = #3
    #<_gb_feed> = #4
o<gb_endpoints> endsub

o<gb_touch> sub
    o<gb_touch_active> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
        (ABORT,Probe remains active before a measuring approach. Abort then Pendant Mode; no new touch move was issued.)
    o<gb_touch_active> endif
    o<gb_endpoints> call [#<_gb_tx>] [#<_gb_ty>] [#<_gb_tz>] [#1]
    #<_gb_stage> = #2
    (X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X. Top touches keep XY unchanged.)
    G38.3 X#<_gb_tx> Y#<_gb_ty> Z#<_gb_tz> F#1
    #<_gb_hit> = #5070
    o<gb_touch_contact> if [#<_gb_hit> EQ 1]
        #<_gb_contact_z> = #5063
        o<gb_record> call [0]
    o<gb_touch_contact> else
        o<gb_fine_missing> if [#2 EQ 1]
            o<gb_record> call [2]
            (ABORT,CAPTURE FAILED - KEEP THE SETUP IN PLACE. The slow block re-touch had no contact. Coarse data is not an accepted measurement. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<gb_fine_missing> endif
        o<gb_record> call [1]
    o<gb_touch_contact> endif
o<gb_touch> endsub

o<gb_release_for_fine> sub
    o<gb_release_side> if [#<_gb_phase> EQ 2]
        (Reverse the side approach. X: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
        o<gb_release> call [#<_gb_ax>] [#<_gb_ay>] [#<_gb_tz>]
    o<gb_release_side> else
        (Release physical UP / LinuxCNC +Z; XY unchanged.)
        o<gb_release> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_gb_clear>]
    o<gb_release_side> endif
o<gb_release_for_fine> endsub

o<gb_release> sub
    o<gb_release_needed> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
        o<gb_endpoints> call [#1] [#2] [#3] [#<_gb_fine>]
        #<_gb_stage> = -1
        (X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X. Vertical returns keep XY unchanged.)
        G38.5 X#1 Y#2 Z#3 F#<_gb_fine>
        #<released> = #5070
        o<gb_record> call [2]
        o<gb_not_released> if [[#<released> NE 1] OR [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]]
            (ABORT,Probe did not release along its return path. Return to clearance could not be completed. Captures are retained; Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<gb_not_released> endif
    o<gb_release_needed> endif
o<gb_release> endsub

o<gb_retract> sub
    (Return physical UP / LinuxCNC +Z only, to the measured top plus clearance.)
    o<gb_release> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_gb_clear>]
    o<gb_guarded> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_gb_clear>] [0]
o<gb_retract> endsub

o<gb_guarded> sub
    o<gb_guarded_move> if [[#1 NE #<_x>] OR [#2 NE #<_y>] OR [#3 NE #<_z>]]
        o<gb_guarded_active> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
            (ABORT,Probe is active before a transfer. Abort then Pendant Mode; no transfer was issued.)
        o<gb_guarded_active> endif
        o<gb_endpoints> call [#1] [#2] [#3] [#<_gb_coarse>]
        #<_gb_stage> = -1
        (X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X. Outside-edge descents hold XY.)
        G38.3 X#1 Y#2 Z#3 F#<_gb_coarse>
        o<gb_guarded_hit> if [#5070 EQ 1]
            (Exact trigger must be durably saved and read back BEFORE recovery.)
            o<gb_record> call [3]
            o<gb_guarded_z_recovery> if [#4 EQ 1]
                o<gb_recover_z> call
                (ABORT,Unexpected Z contact outside the measured block footprint. Trigger retained; probe returned vertically above the measured top. Scan cancelled. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
            o<gb_guarded_z_recovery> endif
            (ABORT,Unexpected contact during a transfer or upward return. Trigger retained; no further move was issued. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<gb_guarded_hit> else
            o<gb_record> call [2]
        o<gb_guarded_hit> endif
    o<gb_guarded_move> endif
o<gb_guarded> endsub

o<gb_recover_z> sub
    (User-requested recovery: UP / LinuxCNC +Z to above the measured block, then cancel.)
    (No X/Y change. No recovery runs in the generic operator Abort hook.)
    o<gb_recovery_upward> if [#<_gb_clear> LE #<_z>]
        (ABORT,Unexpected Z contact has no higher retained clearance target. No substitute return was issued. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<gb_recovery_upward> endif
    o<gb_release> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_gb_clear>]
    o<gb_recovery_remaining> if [#<_z> LT #<_gb_clear>]
        o<gb_endpoints> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_gb_clear>] [#<_gb_fine>]
        G38.3 Z#<_gb_clear> F#<_gb_fine>
        o<gb_recovery_obstructed> if [#5070 EQ 1]
            o<gb_record> call [3]
            (ABORT,The upward recovery encountered another contact before block clearance. Both contacts are retained; recovery stopped. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<gb_recovery_obstructed> endif
    o<gb_recovery_remaining> endif
    o<gb_record> call [5]
    o<gb_recovery_height> if [ABS[#<_z> - #<_gb_clear>] GT [#<_gb_step_z> / 2]]
        (ABORT,The reported recovery endpoint is not above the measured block. No further move was issued. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<gb_recovery_height> endif
o<gb_recover_z> endsub

o<gb_record> sub
    (0 contact, 1 miss, 2 reported movement endpoint, 3 obstruction, 4 clearance ready, 5 recovery, 6 result.)
    #<success> = 0
    #<wx> = #<_x>
    #<wy> = #<_y>
    #<wz> = #<_z>
    o<gb_record_trigger> if [[#1 EQ 0] OR [#1 EQ 3]]
        #<success> = #5070
        #<wx> = #5061
        #<wy> = #5062
        #<wz> = #5063
    o<gb_record_trigger> endif
    #<mx> = [#<wx> + #<_gb_ox>]
    #<my> = [#<wy> + #<_gb_oy>]
    #<mz> = [#<wz> + #<_gb_oz>]
    (LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/block-request.txt)
    (LOG,DMC2_BLOCK_RECORD_V1)
    (LOG,sequence=%d#<_gb_sequence>)
    o<gb_kind> if [#1 EQ 0]
        (LOG,kind=touch)
    o<gb_kind> elseif [#1 EQ 1]
        (LOG,kind=miss)
    o<gb_kind> elseif [#1 EQ 2]
        (LOG,kind=travel)
    o<gb_kind> elseif [#1 EQ 3]
        (LOG,kind=obstruction)
    o<gb_kind> elseif [#1 EQ 4]
        (LOG,kind=ready)
    o<gb_kind> elseif [#1 EQ 5]
        (LOG,kind=recovery)
    o<gb_kind> elseif [#1 EQ 6]
        (LOG,kind=result)
    o<gb_kind> endif
    (LOG,sample=%d#<_gb_sample>)
    (LOG,phase=%d#<_gb_phase>)
    (LOG,column=%d#<_gb_column>)
    (LOG,row=%d#<_gb_row>)
    (LOG,edge=%d#<_gb_edge>)
    (LOG,layer=%d#<_gb_layer>)
    (LOG,stage=%d#<_gb_stage>)
    (LOG,success=%d#<success>)
    (LOG,work_x=%.9f#<wx>)
    (LOG,work_y=%.9f#<wy>)
    (LOG,work_z=%.9f#<wz>)
    (LOG,machine_x=%.9f#<mx>)
    (LOG,machine_y=%.9f#<my>)
    (LOG,machine_z=%.9f#<mz>)
    (LOG,from_x=%.9f#<_gb_from_x>)
    (LOG,from_y=%.9f#<_gb_from_y>)
    (LOG,from_z=%.9f#<_gb_from_z>)
    (LOG,target_x=%.9f#<_gb_to_x>)
    (LOG,target_y=%.9f#<_gb_to_y>)
    (LOG,target_z=%.9f#<_gb_to_z>)
    (LOG,feed=%.9f#<_gb_feed>)
    (LOGCLOSE)
    o<gb_save> call
    o<gb_contact_readback> if [[#1 EQ 0] OR [#1 EQ 3]]
        (DEBUG,Block trigger %.9f#<mx>,#<my>,#<mz> machine mm retained and read back in tmp/output/block.)
    o<gb_contact_readback> endif
o<gb_record> endsub

o<gb_parameters> if [#<_hal[axisui.block-parameters-valid]> NE 1]
    (ABORT,Gauge block settings are invalid. Correct the fields in Custom Scripts then Run. Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<gb_parameters> endif
o<gb_spindle> if [#<_spindle_on> NE 0]
    (ABORT,The spindle must be stopped for a gauge block scan. Use Spindle Stop then Run; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<gb_spindle> endif
M66 P3 L0
o<gb_spindle_report> if [#5399 NE 0]
    (ABORT,The spindle monitor reports running. Stop the spindle before a gauge block scan; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<gb_spindle_report> endif
o<gb_rotation> if [#[5230 + [#5220 - 1] * 20] NE 0]
    (ABORT,Use an unrotated work coordinate frame. The block itself may be rotated; no offsets have been changed.)
o<gb_rotation> endif
M70
G21 G90 G94 G17 G40 G80 G61.1
#<_gb_ox> = [#<_abs_x> - #<_x>]
#<_gb_oy> = [#<_abs_y> - #<_y>]
#<_gb_oz> = [#<_abs_z> - #<_z>]
#<_gb_fine> = 50
#<_gb_coarse> = 200
#<_gb_margin> = #<_hal[axisui.block-clearance-mm]>
#<_gb_step_z> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_2]scale>]]
#<_gb_sequence> = 0
#<_gb_sample> = 0
#<_gb_phase> = 0
#<_gb_column> = 0
#<_gb_row> = 0
#<_gb_edge> = -1
#<_gb_layer> = 0
#<_gb_stage> = -1
#<_gb_clear> = #<_z>
M64 P1
M66 P5 L0
o<gb_selected> if [#5399 NE 1]
    (ABORT,XYZ probe selection was not reported. Abort then Pendant Mode; check the probe selection indication.)
o<gb_selected> endif
o<gb_initial_contact> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
    (ABORT,The probe is already touching. Abort then place it clear above the gauge block using Pendant Mode.)
o<gb_initial_contact> endif
M190 P4 Q0
M66 P5 L0
(LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/block-request.txt)
(LOG,DMC2_BLOCK_RECORD_V1)
(LOG,sequence=%d#<_gb_sequence>)
(LOG,kind=start)
(LOG,x=%.9f#<_x>)
(LOG,y=%.9f#<_y>)
(LOG,z=%.9f#<_z>)
(LOG,offset_x=%.9f#<_gb_ox>)
(LOG,offset_y=%.9f#<_gb_oy>)
(LOG,offset_z=%.9f#<_gb_oz>)
(LOG,x_min=%.9f#<_ini[axis_x]min_limit>)
(LOG,x_max=%.9f#<_ini[axis_x]max_limit>)
(LOG,y_min=%.9f#<_ini[axis_y]min_limit>)
(LOG,y_max=%.9f#<_ini[axis_y]max_limit>)
(LOG,z_min=%.9f#<_ini[axis_z]min_limit>)
(LOG,z_max=%.9f#<_ini[axis_z]max_limit>)
(LOG,search=%.9f#<_hal[axisui.block-search-mm]>)
(LOG,grid=1)
(LOG,drop=%.9f#<_hal[axisui.block-drop-mm]>)
(LOG,clearance=%.9f#<_gb_margin>)
(LOG,side_depth=%.9f#<_hal[axisui.block-side-depth-mm]>)
(LOG,feed=%.9f#<_gb_fine>)
(LOG,coarse_feed=%.9f#<_gb_coarse>)
(LOG,ball_diameter=2)
#<step_x> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_0]scale>]]
#<step_y> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_1]scale>]]
(LOG,step_x=%.9f#<step_x>)
(LOG,step_y=%.9f#<step_y>)
(LOG,step_z=%.9f#<_gb_step_z>)
(LOGCLOSE)
o<gb_save> call

o<gb_scan> while [1]
    M190 P6 Q#<_gb_sequence>
    M66 P5 L0
    o<gb_plan_fresh> if [#<_hal[axisui.block-plan-sequence]> NE #<_gb_sequence>]
        (ABORT,The gauge block planner did not publish this capture sequence. Abort then Pendant Mode. No stale target will be used.)
    o<gb_plan_fresh> endif
    #<next_phase> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-phase]>
    o<gb_finished> if [#<next_phase> EQ 3]
        o<gb_scan> break
    o<gb_finished> endif
    #<_gb_phase> = #<next_phase>
    #<_gb_sample> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-sample]>
    #<_gb_column> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-column]>
    #<_gb_row> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-row]>
    #<_gb_edge> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-edge]>
    #<_gb_layer> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-layer]>
    #<_gb_ax> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-approach-x]>
    #<_gb_ay> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-approach-y]>
    #<_gb_tx> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-target-x]>
    #<_gb_ty> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-target-y]>
    #<_gb_tz> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-target-z]>
    #<_gb_clear> = #<_hal[axisui.block-plan-clear-z]>
    o<gb_plan_still_fresh> if [#<_hal[axisui.block-plan-sequence]> NE #<_gb_sequence>]
        (ABORT,The block plan changed while being read. Abort then Pendant Mode; no new motion was issued.)
    o<gb_plan_still_fresh> endif
    o<gb_not_reference> if [#<_gb_phase> NE 0]
        o<gb_transfer_height> if [ABS[#<_z> - #<_gb_clear>] GT [#<_gb_step_z> / 2]]
            (ABORT,Probe is not at the retained clearance above the block. Abort then Pendant Mode; no lateral transfer was issued.)
        o<gb_transfer_height> endif
        (X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
        o<gb_guarded> call [#<_gb_ax>] [#<_gb_ay>] [#<_gb_clear>] [0]
    o<gb_not_reference> endif
    o<gb_side_descent> if [#<_gb_phase> EQ 2]
        (Outside-edge descent is Z only. Unexpected contact returns vertically above the measured block.)
        o<gb_guarded> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_gb_tz>] [1]
    o<gb_side_descent> endif
    (Top approach is -Z. Side X component: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
    o<gb_touch> call [#<_gb_coarse>] [0]
    o<gb_coarse_hit> if [#<_gb_hit> EQ 1]
        o<gb_release_for_fine> call
        (Repeat identical target and direction at the fine touch feed.)
        (Side X component: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
        o<gb_touch> call [#<_gb_fine>] [1]
        o<gb_measured_top> if [#<_gb_phase> NE 2]
            o<gb_new_clearance> if [[#<_gb_contact_z> + #<_gb_margin>] GT #<_gb_clear>]
                #<_gb_clear> = [#<_gb_contact_z> + #<_gb_margin>]
            o<gb_new_clearance> endif
            o<gb_first_clearance> if [#<_gb_phase> EQ 0]
                #<_gb_clear> = [#<_gb_contact_z> + #<_gb_margin>]
            o<gb_first_clearance> endif
        o<gb_measured_top> endif
    o<gb_coarse_hit> else
        o<gb_missing_reference> if [#<_gb_phase> EQ 0]
            (ABORT,No block top contact within the initial search travel. No top plane was established. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<gb_missing_reference> endif
        o<gb_missing_side> if [#<_gb_phase> EQ 2]
            o<gb_retract> call
            (ABORT,A planned side station had no contact. Returned above the measured top; the scan is cancelled. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<gb_missing_side> endif
    o<gb_coarse_hit> endif
    o<gb_side_withdraw> if [#<_gb_phase> EQ 2]
        (Withdraw along the same side normal before lifting. X: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
        o<gb_release> call [#<_gb_ax>] [#<_gb_ay>] [#<_gb_tz>]
        (X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
        o<gb_guarded> call [#<_gb_ax>] [#<_gb_ay>] [#<_gb_tz>] [0]
    o<gb_side_withdraw> endif
    o<gb_retract> call
    o<gb_endpoints> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_z>] [#<_gb_fine>]
    #<_gb_stage> = -1
    o<gb_record> call [4]
    (DEBUG,Gauge block sample %d#<_gb_sample> retained; phase %d#<_gb_phase>, circuit %d#<_gb_layer>. Probe at measured-top clearance.)
o<gb_scan> endwhile
M65 P1
M66 P5 L0
o<gb_selection_release> if [#5399 NE 0]
    (ABORT,Scan ended but program probe selection did not clear. Use Abort then Pendant Mode; data is retained in tmp/output/block.)
o<gb_selection_release> endif
o<gb_endpoints> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_z>] [#<_gb_fine>]
#<_gb_stage> = -1
o<gb_record> call [6]
(DEBUG,Gauge block scan ended at top clearance. Exact contacts, movements and relative plane fits are in tmp/output/block.)
M72
M2

%
